@fact amaranth.healer
# en: Runs the infirmary and teaches the healing half of Alchemy & Healing. Believes no excuse.
text [63b5e6] = 掌管医务室，教炼金与治愈里治愈的那一半。任何借口她都不信。

@fact amaranth.truth
# en: She treats the true version of an injury faster than the story you tell her, and she always knows which one you told.
text [76020a] = 你说出伤的真实来历，她治得比听你编的故事更快；而你说的是哪一种，她总是知道。
# en: Tell her how you really got hurt, and see.
hint [fee182] = 跟她说说你到底是怎么受的伤，看看会怎样。

@fact amaranth.rounds
# en: She does evening rounds of every bed herself, and has never once missed one.
text [8c9554] = 每晚的查房她都亲自走遍每张床，从未落下过一次。
# en: Watch the infirmary at evening.
hint [22747d] = 傍晚时留意一下医务室。

@fact amaranth.key
# en: Only a handful of students have ever been trusted with the key to her tonic cupboard.
text [5f5b57] = 被托付过她补剂柜钥匙的学生，屈指可数。
# en: Some students are trusted with more than tonics.
hint [1b0506] = 有些学生被托付的，不只是补药。

@fact amaranth.count
# en: She counts every remedy twice, because the second count is the true one, and keeps a black jar on the top shelf for a curse not seen since her first year.
text [ec82ec] = 每一样药她都要数两遍，因为第二遍才是准的；她在最高一层架子上留着一只黑罐子，为的是一种她第一年之后就再没见过的诅咒。
# en: Help her restock over a break.
hint [af1a5c] = 假期里帮她补货。

@fact amaranth.cupboard
# en: She leaves the tonic cupboard open at teatime on purpose, to see who will help themselves, and writes their names in a book.
text [1223c9] = 她故意在下午茶时间敞着补药柜，看谁会自己动手，再把他们的名字记进一本簿子里。
# en: Look in the tonic cupboard at teatime.
hint [41fc41] = 下午茶时去看看补药柜。

@fact amaranth.book
# en: She keeps a book of the remedies her students invented, written out in her own square hand.
text [3bfc5a] = 她有一本簿子，用她方正的字迹抄录着学生们自创的药方。
# en: Invent a remedy under her eye.
hint [3f7758] = 在她眼皮底下发明一种药。
